Package: rhleaves
Type: Package
Title: Leaf attributes from plants at Rose-Hulman Institute of Technology
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Eric", "Reyes",
      email = "reyesem@rose-hulman.edu",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Rose-Hulman Institute of Technology maintains to living walls on
    campus.  Each living wall has several species of plants with almond-shaped
    leaves.  A sample of the leaves was obtained in April, 2025 and various
    attributes measured.
